{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深圳一日遊想玩啲新嘢？今個週末可以同朋友去福田鬥卡丁車、組隊玩真人CS，或者約埋閨蜜行華僑城，再歎個精油SPA。出發前，記得先睇由 JEZZ點子生活策劃嘅年度企劃【北上封神榜・神級快閃祭】。活動搜羅大灣區嘅地道美食、潮玩體驗、養生同健康護理優惠，逢星期三中午12點喺 JEZZ.hk 發放限量優惠，指...</p>\n<p>深圳一日遊想玩啲新嘢？今個週末可以同朋友去福田鬥卡丁車、組隊玩真人CS，或者約埋閨蜜行華僑城，再歎個精油SPA。出發前，記得先睇由 <strong>JEZZ點子生活策劃嘅年度企劃【北上封神榜・神級快閃祭】</strong>。活動搜羅大灣區嘅地道美食、潮玩體驗、養生同健康護理優惠，<strong>逢星期三中午12點</strong>喺 JEZZ.hk 發放限量優惠，指定體驗低至1折。先揀心水、搶券，成功後就可以喺會員中心搵到專屬 <strong>JezzCODE</strong>，到店出示兌換。\n</p>\n<p>今輪快閃 <strong>11月18日（星期三）中午12點</strong>開搶，！想放電，<strong>HK$19.8</strong>就買到<strong>福田中洲灣KP-FUN全日飛</strong>，可以玩卡丁車、夜光真人CS同碰碰車，食完飯仲可以返入場繼續玩。</p>\n<p>想行慢啲，<strong>HK$20</strong>就搶到<strong>友頤養生館¥200全場通用代金券</strong>，行完華僑城再做SPA。想順道去羅湖食餐好，仲有 <strong>HK$10搶湘辣辣¥100代金券</strong>。下文整理埋必玩項目、招牌菜同分店地址，方便你搶完券就排行程。</p>\n<h2>深圳一日遊快閃優惠一覽｜11月18日中午12點開搶</h2>\n<figure>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>商戶</th>\n<th>優惠</th>\n<th>快閃價</th>\n<th>名額</th>\n<th>購買</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>KP-FUN福田中洲灣店</th>\n<td>全天單人票</td>\n<td>HK$19.8</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/KP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82-%5BKP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82%5D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%A9%E5%96%AE%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%8E%A9%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%A1%E9%99%90%E9%80%B2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%7C%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%B4%B2%E7%81%A3%E5%B0%88%E4%BA%AB%7C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%80%7C%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E6%A8%99-663?campaign_id=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">即搶全日飛</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>友頤養生館</th>\n<td>¥200全場通用代金券</td>\n<td>HK$20</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/%E5%8F%8B%E9%A0%A4%E9%A4%8A%E7%94%9F%E9%A4%A8-%C2%A5200%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A3%E9%87%91%E5%88%B8%20(%E5%85%A8%E5%A0%B4%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8)-651?campaign_id=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">即搶友頤券</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>湘辣辣羅湖益田假日廣場店</th>\n<td>¥100代金券</td>\n<td>HK$10</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/%E7%BE%85%E6%B9%96%E7%9B%8A%E7%94%B0%E5%81%87%E6%97%A5%E5%BB%A3%E5%A0%B4-%5B%E5%BF%AB%E9%96%83%E5%84%AA%E6%83%A0%5D%E6%B9%98%E8%BE%A3%E8%BE%A3%C2%A5100%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A3%E9%87%91%E5%88%B8%20%7C%20%E7%BE%85%E6%B9%96%E7%9B%8A%E7%94%B0%E5%81%87%E6%97%A5%E5%BB%A3%E5%A0%B4%20%7C%20%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E8%8F%9C%20%7C%20%E9%AE%AE%E7%82%92%E9%BB%83%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89-666?campaign_id=12\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">即搶湘菜券</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>格倫菲爾口腔</th>\n<td>¥200植牙／箍牙代金券</td>\n<td>HK$1</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/campaign/gba-god-list\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">前往活動頁</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</figure>\n<h2>深圳一日遊推介1｜福田KP-FUN全日飛，必玩卡丁車＋夜光真人CS</h2>\n<p><strong>KP-FUN 潮玩遊樂街區</strong>已迅速成為大灣區玩樂新地標！佔地足足 7 萬呎、跨越雙層的超大空間，顛覆傳統遊樂場概念，將 Cyberpunk（賽博龐克）主題完美融入全場景，為你帶來極致沉浸式的未來探索體驗。全日飛可以同日多次進出，朝早先玩最想玩嘅項目，肚餓就落樓食嘢，食完再返入場。幾個朋友口味唔同，有人想鬥車，有人想唱K，都可以各自揀好再會合。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-7_9056890876afbd2c23e8bd-1024x683.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"深圳一日遊 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-7_9056890876afbd2c23e8bd-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>必玩3大項目</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多次元數碼遊樂場：</strong>匯聚逾 100 款科技潮玩項目！必玩 MotionVR 機甲、全息競技及光影迷宮，一步踏入未來世界。</li>\n<li><strong>極速挑戰與競技：</strong>體驗 MR 卡丁車的虛實交錯、挑戰無動力競速光輪、真人 CS、AR 競技及保齡球，更有「深圳室內最大碰碰車場」等你瘋狂連撞！</li>\n<li><strong>潮玩互動實驗室：</strong>隨處可見的互動藝術裝置與滿載科技感的網紅打卡點，絕對是社交媒體洗版必備。</li>\n</ul>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-1_1575562446afbd2f89b8fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-1_1575562446afbd2f89b8fe-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2_6003967356afbd2fe94e8a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2_6003967356afbd2fe94e8a-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-3_951700926afbd303e68b5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-3_951700926afbd303e68b5-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-4_515806806afbd30a00449.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-4_515806806afbd30a00449-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-5_5488464396afbd31033a61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-5_5488464396afbd31033a61-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-6_18811673856afbd31722bd0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-6_18811673856afbd31722bd0-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-8_17968572016afbd31c611d2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-8_17968572016afbd31c611d2-1024x1536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-13_9004442746afbd32062e50.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-13_9004442746afbd32062e50-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-14_17465046586afbd325345dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-14_17465046586afbd325345dd-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-15_13060887636afbd32ccbf8b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-15_13060887636afbd32ccbf8b-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-23_13560546476afbd33d0b412.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-23_13560546476afbd33d0b412-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-26_18110961286afbd3421cdc2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-26_18110961286afbd3421cdc2-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>分店地址</strong>　深圳市福田區濱河大道9283號，中洲灣 C Future City 3樓 L3-309<br/>\n<strong>交通</strong>　深圳地鐵9號線下沙站<br/>\n<strong>營業時間</strong>　10:00–22:00</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/KP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82-%5BKP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82%5D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%A9%E5%96%AE%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%8E%A9%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%A1%E9%99%90%E9%80%B2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%7C%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%B4%B2%E7%81%A3%E5%B0%88%E4%BA%AB%7C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%80%7C%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E6%A8%99-663?campaign_id=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">JEZZ神級快閃 | $19.8即搶福田KP-FUN全天單人票</a>\n<h2>深圳一日遊推介2｜華僑城行街做SPA，$20搶友頤養生館¥200券</h2>\n<p>想同閨蜜安排一日慢遊，可以下午先去華僑城創意文化園逛書店、睇文創小店，再去友頤養生館歎個SPA。位於深圳的高端中式按摩館「友頤養生館」，主打「自然療癒」與「私人會所級」環境。全店洗手間配備 TOTO 智能潔具及 Dyson 風筒，獨立包房更設有 80 吋大屏幕電視與五星級隔音設備。今次推出的「精油SPA代金券」，讓你在高雅靜謐的專屬空間內，享受極致放鬆的 Me Time！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-product-offer_16471125496afbd417192f7-1024x697.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"深圳一日遊 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"653\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-product-offer_16471125496afbd417192f7-1024x697.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>招牌必選｜深層放鬆精油SPA</strong>　行完街想集中按肩頸背，可以揀深層放鬆精油SPA。如果想留多啲時間慢慢歎，亦可以問生態園店嘅全身精油SPA。預約時可以一併確認項目時長、價錢同用券安排。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>華僑城店</strong>　深圳市南山區華僑城西街51號，鴻波酒店2樓。深圳地鐵1號線華僑城站 B出口。</li>\n<li><strong>生態園店</strong>　深圳市南山區粵海街道，科技生態園1棟B座2樓。</li>\n</ul>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2_7692449446afbd492d0db5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"617\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2_7692449446afbd492d0db5-1024x658.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/3_18897220436afbd49c5a16e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"507\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/3_18897220436afbd49c5a16e-1024x541.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/4_16241993276afbd4a51b877.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"507\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/4_16241993276afbd4a51b877-1024x541.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5_17011355836afbd4ad01643.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"775\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/5_17011355836afbd4ad01643-1024x827.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_18285864176afbd4b21383a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"536\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_18285864176afbd4b21383a-1024x572.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_633529076afbd4b93bbbc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1054\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_633529076afbd4b93bbbc-1024x1124.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/4_12475577536afbd4bcd6026.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"544\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/4_12475577536afbd4bcd6026-1024x580.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/0_9289549176afbd4c41d0e2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"939\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/0_9289549176afbd4c41d0e2-1024x1002.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cgy-20210111-70_8205100606afbd4c750203.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1056\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cgy-20210111-70_8205100606afbd4c750203-1024x1126.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/KP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82-%5BKP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82%5D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%A9%E5%96%AE%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%8E%A9%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%A1%E9%99%90%E9%80%B2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%7C%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%B4%B2%E7%81%A3%E5%B0%88%E4%BA%AB%7C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%80%7C%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E6%A8%99-663?campaign_id=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">JEZZ神級快閃 | $20即搶友頤養生館¥200全場通用代金券</a>\n<h2>羅湖晚餐加碼｜$10搶湘辣辣¥100券，必試鮮炒花龍＋五花趾</h2>\n<p>玩完想去羅湖食晚飯，可以去益田假日廣場嘅湘辣辣。呢間湘菜連鎖以<strong>分部位鮮炒黃牛肉</strong>打響名堂，將潮汕牛肉火鍋按部位揀肉嘅食法，融入湖南小炒。幾個人去，可以叫兩款牛肉比較口感，再加一碟農家小炒，配白飯就啱晒。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/59eafcd91d2d8421fb31d7bb5c514fe5_647691856afbd52407447-1024x1351.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"深圳一日遊 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"641\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/59eafcd91d2d8421fb31d7bb5c514fe5_647691856afbd52407447-1024x1351.jpg\" width=\"486\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>鮮炒黃牛肉</strong>　第一次去就由招牌入手。牛肉現切現炒，趁熱夾一筷子送飯。</li>\n<li><strong>招牌鮮炒花龍＋鮮炒五花趾</strong>　想試唔同部位可以兩款一齊叫，鍾意牛肉帶筋、有咬口就先試五花趾。</li>\n<li><strong>農家一碗香＋原味衡東絲瓜</strong>　一碟送飯小炒配一碟清爽絲瓜。鍾意食內臟，亦可以加點酸菜肥腸煲。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>分店地址</strong>　深圳市羅湖區華麗路2038號，羅湖益田假日廣場 L4層 L4-03／04／05號舖<br/>\n<strong>交通</strong>　深圳地鐵翠竹站 B2出口，步行約5分鐘<br/>\n<strong>營業時間</strong>　10:30–21:30</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/a1aa22acbc4d41c722c5a6c007bda6b8_1621842776afbd53e945f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1262\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/a1aa22acbc4d41c722c5a6c007bda6b8_1621842776afbd53e945f8-1024x1346.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/4bab6b82aa26d33f9b7649c1070c9857_19538076076afbd54485bf0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1263\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/4bab6b82aa26d33f9b7649c1070c9857_19538076076afbd54485bf0-1024x1347.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image_20261019111147_82_29_7594385386afbd548847b2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image_20261019111147_82_29_7594385386afbd548847b2-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/KP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82-%5BKP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82%5D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%A9%E5%96%AE%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%8E%A9%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%A1%E9%99%90%E9%80%B2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%7C%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%B4%B2%E7%81%A3%E5%B0%88%E4%BA%AB%7C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%80%7C%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E6%A8%99-663?campaign_id=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">JEZZ神級快閃 | $10即搶湘辣辣¥100代金券</a>\n<h2>同場快閃｜$1搶格倫菲爾口腔¥200植牙／箍牙代金券</h2>\n<p>格倫菲爾口腔係深圳連鎖牙科機構，喺羅湖、福田等區設有院區，提供種植牙及牙齒矯正服務。本身有計劃了解植牙或箍牙，可以按慣用口岸揀院區。今輪<strong>HK$1可買面值¥200嘅代金券，名額500個</strong>，可用於抵扣指定項目費用。使用前須預約，診療方案同收費按牙醫評估而定。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1229b86b-6eb1-418d-852d-b3d0253cd0e0_10517808056afbd5c6942c9-1024x561.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"深圳一日遊 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"526\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1229b86b-6eb1-418d-852d-b3d0253cd0e0_10517808056afbd5c6942c9-1024x561.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>羅湖口岸院區</strong>　深圳市羅湖區大中華茂業天地環球經貿廣場南塔6樓。</li>\n<li><strong>羅湖國貿院區</strong>　深圳市羅湖區人民南路2069號，國際商業大廈北座嘉賓路二層A號。</li>\n<li><strong>福田崗廈院區</strong>　深圳市福田區福華路文蔚大廈1至3樓。</li>\n<li><strong>福田車公廟國際院區</strong>　深圳市福田區深南大道金潤大廈3樓。</li>\n</ul>\n<a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/KP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82-%5BKP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82%5D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%A9%E5%96%AE%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%8E%A9%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%A1%E9%99%90%E9%80%B2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%7C%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%B4%B2%E7%81%A3%E5%B0%88%E4%BA%AB%7C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%80%7C%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E6%A8%99-663?campaign_id=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">JEZZ神級快閃 | $10即搶湘辣辣¥100代金券</a>\n<h2>11月18日中午12點開搶｜限量四款優惠，售完即止</h2>\n<p><strong>11月18日（星期三）中午12點準時開賣！</strong> 想同朋友一齊去，記得提早登入JEZZ.hk，夠鐘就撳入去搶心水優惠。四款優惠限量發售，售完即止。</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.jezz.hk/offer/detail/KP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82-%5BKP-FUN%E9%81%8A%E6%A8%82%5D%E5%85%A8%E5%A4%A9%E5%96%AE%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%A8%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E7%A5%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%8E%A9%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%A1%E9%99%90%E9%80%B2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%7C%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%B4%B2%E7%81%A3%E5%B0%88%E4%BA%AB%7C%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E7%A6%8F%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%80%7C%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E6%A8%99-663?campaign_id=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">JEZZ神級快閃 | 即上JEZZ.hk搶深圳一日遊優惠</a>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:08:40.570756+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2803,"images":28,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:24:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:02:04.091603+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:02:04.091603+00:00","content_hash":"87cc6e75bb945d4ba0eb024ee87104e3285fca29c9e3caa66d801e8137a56e46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}